
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#100b1c">
  <meta name="description" content="REXZYSTORE - Toko digital dan key game.">
  <title>REXZYSTORE | Toko Digital</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; color: #f7f1ff;
      background: #0b0812;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      padding: 22px 7%; display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #332044;
    }
    .logo { color: #c78aff; font-weight: 900; font-size: 23px; }
    .tag { color: #b9a9c9; font-size: 12px; }
    main { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; padding: 45px 20px; }
    .hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 38px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 7vw, 52px); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hero h1 span { color: #c78aff; }
    .hero p { color: #b9a9c9; line-height: 1.7; }
    .product {
      max-width: 480px; margin: auto; padding: 26px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #21152f, #120d1b);
      border: 1px solid #70459b; border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px #9b45ff18;
    }
    .label {
      display: inline-block; color: #d9b6ff;
      background: #49276a; border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 6px 11px; font-size: 12px;
    }
    .product h2 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .desc { color: #b9a9c9; line-height: 1.6; }
    .price { color: #d6a8ff; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; }
    button {
      width: 100%; padding: 14px; border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px; color: #160c20;
      background: #c78aff; font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover { background: #d9b6ff; }
    .notice {
      margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #493455; border-radius: 10px;
      color: #cbbbd8; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center; padding: 25px;
      color: #8f809d; border-top: 1px solid #332044;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    dialog {
      width: min(90%, 400px); background: #1b1127;
      color: white; border: 1px solid #70459b;
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px;
    }
    dialog::backdrop { background: #000b; }
    .secondary {
      margin-top: 10px; background: #332044;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">REXZYSTORE</div>
    <div class="tag">TOKO DIGITAL</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Upgrade Your <span>Experience.</span></h1>
      <p>Selamat datang di REXZYSTORE.<br>
      Temukan produk digital pilihanmu dengan mudah.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="product">
      <span class="label">PRODUK DIGITAL</span>
      <h2>Config Animasi Dreamspace</h2>
      <p class="desc">
        Key digital untuk produk Config Animasi Dreamspace.
        Pastikan perangkatmu kompatibel sebelum membeli.
      </p>
      <div class="price">Rp13.000</div>
      <p class="desc">1 key · Pembayaran sekali</p>
      <button onclick="document.getElementById('checkout').showModal()">
        Beli Sekarang
      </button>
      <div class="notice">
        Pembayaran dan pengiriman key otomatis belum diaktifkan.
        Jangan melakukan pembayaran melalui halaman demo ini.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <dialog id="checkout">
    <h2>Konfirmasi Pembelian</h2>
    <p>Config Animasi Dreamspace — Rp13.000</p>
    <p class="desc">
      Checkout belum tersedia. Sistem QRIS dan pengiriman key
      akan diaktifkan setelah penyedia pembayaran terhubung.
    </p>
    <button onclick="document.getElementById('checkout').close()">
      Mengerti
    </button>
  </dialog>

  <footer>© 2026 REXZYSTORE · Toko Digital</footer>
</body>
</html>
